        "Hamant et al. (2008) & Heisler et al. (2010) pressurized SAM shell stress tensor, cortical microtubule alignment, and PIN1-auxin phyllotactic mechanics faithfully reproduces Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & floral primordia) morphology" ;
